Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.13,0:02:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.09,0:02:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're not good enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you have someone stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can fight me if you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unguarded!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make use of this for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Purgatory...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.29,0:02:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Onigiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.39,0:03:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Samurai-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without laying a finger...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Send him flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"Zoro, Stunned!\NThe Shocking Identity of the Mysterious Woman!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:36.17,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,EXCAVATION LABOR CAMP, UDON
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, come on! Kick their asses now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna join a sumo match myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.56,0:04:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you that you'd get killed\Nif you mess with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, the spit guy from earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not just Alpaca-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Madillo-man! A Gifter who ate...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,the Armadillo Smile Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:16.89,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,MADILLO-MAN - A GIFTER\NARMADILLO SMILE FRUIT
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, your body looks so tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Perfect for my training!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.99,0:05:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The bullets that are loaded in these\Nare made of the Sea Prism Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since you're a power-user,\Ngo ahead and curl up in a ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like an armadillo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys are finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't he see? They're \Nnot finished at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.11,0:06:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To set an example for other prisoners,\NI'll take my time torturing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,First you, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll begin with you, you worthless shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.28,0:06:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go right, crouch down, and jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.01,0:06:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Run!\N--Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Crouch down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--And...\N--Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.39,0:06:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn, damn, damn, damn, damn, damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good job, old man! Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the...\NCan you foresee the future or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No one can do that!\NWhat did you actually do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't get him! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Unbelievable...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man! Go left next!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--What?!\N--You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit, that old shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.53,0:07:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Left! Left! Left! Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn, you little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.43,0:07:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.81,0:08:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't take me down with guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have no other option!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without laying a finger, send him flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.87,0:08:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's just the normal Color of Arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.19,0:08:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.07,0:08:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Arma-Defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Again, this is just the \Nnormal Color of Arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! You're not gonna hit me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Alpaca Fencing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Which way should I go next?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw hat man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.44,0:09:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's easier this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.21,0:09:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do it, Alpaca-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down!\NI don't wanna give you any more trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, actually, the heavier the better!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For my training!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:09:57.88,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,FLOWER CAPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:02.35,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,RASETSU TOWN, FLOWER CAPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:07.98,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,PRISON
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.98,0:10:09.02,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,RASETSU PRISON
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:14.32,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,RASETSU TOWN PRISONERS' QUARTERS\NAKA: PUBLIC CELLS
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't expect to see this \Nmany ruffians in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,People, have a good look at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.03,0:10:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These are the faces of the fools\Nwho want to rebel against Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0} and Kaido-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get your ass in there already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel sorry for you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your plot has already been revealed...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a complete failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fukurokuju-{\i1}dono{\i0}, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.75,0:11:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What makes you think that\Nthis ankle tattoo is the symbol of rebellion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is just a popular design!\NWe have nothing to do with any kind of rebellion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.43,0:11:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut it out!\NThen, how do you explain about this flyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Reversed Crescent Moon\Nat the center of the flyer...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.97,0:11:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I assume it is a symbol pointing to a rebellion\Nagainst Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks just like your tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.19,0:11:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is an order from Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}.\NJust shut up and stay in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're in big trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will everyone think...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that we told them about the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.71,0:12:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know Captain will believe us...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Alpaca Fencing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?! Finish it up already!\NAlpaca-man! Madillo-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just take them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you trying to help us\Nby carrying the old man, Straw Hat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! Bring me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.45,0:13:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're already playing into our hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Let's use a combination technique!\N--Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Madillo Spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.59,0:13:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Alpaca Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, they've merged together!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here comes the combination technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.60,0:13:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Great! Go get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Bring more!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaido's body is far tougher than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That wasn't it! I can't do it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You sent them flying. \NWasn't that good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it wasn't, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Every time you hit someone,\Nyou've been saying, "That wasn't it" this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What am I trying to do? I'm training myself!\NI have to become strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Training yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Despite being in the middle of a deadly show,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}is he training himself?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna throw a punch that will send my enemies flying\Nwithout touching them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That way,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I can break Kaido's tough scales!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:54.66,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,NORTHERN GRAVEYARD, RINGO
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You are...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.26,0:16:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You surprised me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please do not get up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.71,0:16:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is not good for your wound...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's right! You don't need to get up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much for \Nsaving our lives earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you got badly injured in return...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.91,0:17:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I really don't know what to do\Nto repay you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got hurt because I suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys have nothing to do with it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did he go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.97,0:17:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He still has Shusui!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.68,0:17:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, you cannot go out \Nwith such a grave wound!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.82,0:17:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.07,0:17:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The wound is on that side, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.52,0:17:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.45,0:17:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gee...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do not go! Your wound has not yet healed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.25,0:17:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, ow, ow, ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:17:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said my wound is right there!\NWhy can't you see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I am so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, um, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.23,0:18:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna be fine, Samurai-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll get better soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.27,0:18:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I stole this toad oil \Nointment in the capital...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.64,0:18:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, I bought it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You stole it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, I bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.31,0:18:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I don't care either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toad oil is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.77,0:18:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you apply it to a sword-cut,\Nit'll just go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toad oil, huh?\NWell, I hope it'll work!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Samurai-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.25,0:18:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at least until the wound heals,\Nyou had better stay here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You got something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Do you want some now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like to have more?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gyukimaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.84,0:19:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone knows him in the capital.\NGyukimaru on Bandit's Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.97,0:19:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've already taken the great sword - Shusui\Nback to where it belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is a treasure which was stolen from\Nthe legendary samurai of the Land of Wano - Ryuma's grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.61,0:20:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We do not know where he lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but the warrior monk shows himself\Nwhenever an armed person tries to cross the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I can always meet him there?\NThen there's no need to hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.25,0:20:15.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who that Gyukimaru is,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but first, who are you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That Grim Reaper was after your lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The thing is we made\Nthe Shogun of the Land of Wano angry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.27,0:20:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Shogun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.20,0:20:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oro... Oroshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You made him angry\Nso he sent that assassin after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.05,0:20:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, if one makes him angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.63,0:20:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,they must die in the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.13,0:21:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Samurai-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.13,0:21:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Toko!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:04.26,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,TOKO
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.98,0:21:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you say it with an "O,"\Nit's Otoko (Male), but I'm not male!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:07.43,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,OTOKO
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.87,0:21:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.16,0:21:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone says it's funny!\NWhy don't you think so?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.58,0:21:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.69,0:21:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You are attired as a samurai from the Land of Wano,\Nbut you are from overseas, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.12,0:21:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't look like a bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A bad per...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.00,0:21:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.89,0:21:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Say it smoothly!\N--I am sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.92,0:21:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Samurai-{\i1}san{\i0}, you look scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.76,0:21:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you're a really nice person\Nbecause you saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.17,0:22:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.55,0:22:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will tell you a secret,\Nbut you must keep it...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.14,0:22:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.43,0:22:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to find my older brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.98,0:22:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We were separated 20 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.28,0:22:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He might be in the Land of Wano now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:22:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.87,0:23:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kozuki Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.17,0:23:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm his sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.17,0:23:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:22.53,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Luffy keeps on fighting,\Nseeking to learn the way to strike a blow against Kaido!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.53,0:23:26.90,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Ryuo is the name of the Land of \NWano's Haki! To share its essence,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.90,0:23:29.83,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,Old Man Hyo challenges a formidable enemy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.83,0:23:36.26,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When Old Man Hyo's all-out punch roars,\NLuffy breaks new ground!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.26,0:23:40.88,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"Get the Hang of It! The Land of Wano's Haki - Ryuo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.88,0:23:44.59,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.59,0:23:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.59,0:23:48.59,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
